sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Angular Web UI
    participant EDGE as API Edge
    participant AUTH as Identity and Authorization Integration
    participant CIS as Cloud Identity Service
    participant PR as Pricing Service
    participant PS as Pricing Data Store
    participant K as Kafka / Event Backbone
    participant PUB as Publication and Integration Service
    participant CMS as Channel Management System
    participant QS as Query Read Store

    U->>UI: Log in
    UI->>EDGE: Login request
    EDGE->>AUTH: Authenticate
    AUTH->>CIS: Validate credentials / identity
    CIS-->>AUTH: Auth result
    AUTH-->>EDGE: User identity + authorization context
    EDGE-->>UI: Login success

    U->>UI: Change base rate for hotel/date
    UI->>EDGE: Price change request
    EDGE->>PR: Change price
    PR->>AUTH: Validate permissions for hotel/function
    AUTH-->>PR: Authorized
    PR->>PS: Persist pricing changes
    PR->>QS: Make prices available for query
    PR->>K: Publish pricing event
    K-->>PUB: Pricing event
    PUB->>CMS: Push updated prices
    CMS-->>PUB: Acknowledgement